{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6201","title":"Xiaomi Unveils Five Smart Tech Appliances, Including Major Appliances, TV, and Robot Vacuum","desc":"Xiaomi today unveiled its new Smart Tech Appliances lineup for the global market, including new TVs, air conditioners, a refrigerator, a washer-dryer, and a robot vacuum.","view_cnt":"3144","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1779714315","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/880_operatorx_operatorx_opx/25/05/2026/2ea5308d4fcba6483c468e492b137a39.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVienna, AUSTRIA, May 28, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e– \u003c/span\u003eXiaomi today unveiled its new Smart Tech Appliances lineup for the global market, including new TVs, air conditioners, a refrigerator, a washer-dryer, and a robot vacuum. Following Xiaomi's Smart Tech Appliances' global debut last year, these new products mark another expansion and a major step forward in Xiaomi's \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem strategy, bringing smarter connectivity, greater efficiency, and more intelligent living experiences to households worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new lineup combines intelligent performance, advanced energy efficiency, and seamless connectivity across everyday home scenarios. Xiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026 delivers an immersive entertainment experience with advanced QD-Mini LED technology,¹ enhanced refresh rates,² and upgraded audio performance for vivid visuals and smooth motion.³ Mijia Air Conditioner GentleAir creates a softer, more comfortable airflow with precision micro-hole air flaps, while supporting 30-second fast cooling, 60-second rapid heating,⁴ and AI-powered energy optimization.⁵ Mijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L offers generous multi-zone storage with Ag\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Cambria Math\u0026quot;, serif;\"\u003e⁺\u003c/span\u003e Fresh technology to help reduce odors and maintain freshness,⁶ alongside dual inverter technology for quieter and more energy-efficient cooling. Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg combines washing and drying in one solution, achieving 30% higher energy efficiency than the EU Class A threshold⁷ while eliminating 99.99% of bacteria with high-temperature steam.⁸ Xiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro completes the smart home experience with 15,000Pa⁹ powerful suction, dual anti-tangle technology,¹⁰ and an all-in-one auto base station for effortless hands-free cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll five new home appliances are integrated into the Xiaomi ecosystem, enabling smarter and more convenient home management. Through Xiaomi Home app, users can monitor real-time device status, receive helpful notifications, customize settings remotely, and benefit from OTA software updates from anywhere. Compatible models also support Google Assistant or Alexa,¹¹ adding seamless voice control for an even more intuitive smart home experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/606_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/05/2026/0ac36229bc0782b4acd7a0cae74da47b.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026: Brings Cinematic Mini LED Entertainment Home\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026 is available in 55\", 65\", 75\", 85\", and 98\" models to suit a variety of living spaces and entertainment needs. Finished in elegant dark gray with a stable double-stand design, the series combines a sleek minimalist aesthetic with a premium viewing experience, achieving up to a 98% screen-to-body ratio across the lineup.¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePowered by QD-Mini LED technology, Xiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026 delivers deep contrast, vivid detail, and impressive brightness with up to 1200 nits peak brightness,¹³ a 94% DCI-P3 wide color gamut,¹⁴ and 1.07 billion colors.¹⁵ The series also supports HDR10+, HLG, and Filmmaker Mode for more lifelike visuals, while Dolby Vision®¹⁶ further enhances cinematic immersion on the 85\" and 98\" models. Designed for smoother entertainment and gaming experiences, the 55\", 65\", and 75\" models support up to 120Hz refresh rate in Game Boost mode,¹⁷ while the flagship 85\" and 98\" models feature a native 144Hz refresh rate¹⁸ that can be boosted up to 288Hz in Game Boost mode¹⁹ for ultra-smooth, blur-free motion in fast-paced content. Complementing the visuals, dual 15W speakers across the lineup deliver immersive audio with Dolby Audio™²⁰ and DTS:X support, while the 85\" and 98\" models further elevate the experience with Dolby Atmos®²¹ for more cinematic and immersive sound.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePowered by Google TV™, Xiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026 brings together streaming apps, personalized recommendations, and seamless smart home connectivity in one platform.²² Support for Apple AirPlay,²³ Google Assistant, and Google Cast²⁴ further enables convenient cross-device connectivity and voice control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/375_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/05/2026/97d0fbcd2749be7ff02713a8091f60b7.jpg\" alt=\"Multiple screens display stunning patterns of flowers, with screen sizes of 98 inches, 85 inches, 75 inches, 65 inches, and 55 inches, set against a dark background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMijia Air Conditioner GentleAir: Fast Cooling and Gentle Airflow for Room-Wide Comfort\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned to deliver softer and more comfortable airflow, Mijia Air Conditioner GentleAir is available in 2.6 kW, 3.5 kW, 5.2 kW, and 7.0 kW variants for different living spaces. Its innovative soft air vane disperses strong airflow at the source, replacing harsh direct drafts with a gentle and even breeze.²⁵ To further enhance comfort, it features three dedicated airflow modes for different scenarios: Halo Flow creates surrounding circulation to minimize direct drafts, Canopy Flow gently cools from above for wider coverage, while Carpet Flow allows warm air to rise naturally from the floor. Built for both comfort and efficiency, Mijia Air Conditioner GentleAir supports 30-second fast cooling and 60-second fast heating for rapid temperature adjustment,⁴ while Turbo Mode instantly unlocks maximum cooling or heating performance with a single tap. Four-way swing airflow further adapts airflow direction for more flexible comfort across different spaces.²⁶ Powered by Mijia AI Energy Saving mode, it dynamically adjusts operating frequency based on real-time conditions, improving energy efficiency by up to 24.5% depending on the model.⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for smarter connectivity, Mijia Air Conditioner GentleAir integrates seamlessly with Xiaomi Home app, enabling remote power control, fan speed adjustment, mode switching, and more. Beyond convenient control, AI continuously learns user preferences and adjusts settings based on real-time environmental data to optimize comfort while reducing the need for manual setup. The display brightness also automatically adapts to ambient light, creating a more comfortable sleep environment.²⁷ For added convenience, it further supports hands-free voice control via Google Assistant,¹¹ offering effortless smart home interaction.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/922_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/05/2026/9532388707864f6737d8bf161e161b0a.jpg\" alt=\"The indoor environment features an air conditioner installed on the wall, alongside a round wooden table. On the table, there is a plate of fruit and a book. The room contains a sofa and chairs, and outside the window, one can see green plants and distant mountains.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L: Expansive Storage Meets Freshness Protection\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned with a premium stainless steel color and modern side-by-side configuration, Mijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L blends seamlessly into contemporary kitchen spaces while delivering generous storage for everyday family needs. It features a spacious 621-liter capacity, including 385 liters for refrigeration and 236 liters for freezing.²⁸ Inside, three-tier storage and a total of 18 compartments provide greater flexibility for organizing groceries, beverages, and bulk items more efficiently. Powered by dual inverter technology, Mijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L delivers energy-efficient performance alongside rapid and even surround cooling to maintain consistent temperatures throughout both compartments. Ag\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Cambria Math\u0026quot;, serif;\"\u003e⁺\u003c/span\u003e Fresh technology further enhances freshness by reducing odors and bacteria such as E. coli,⁶ supporting cleaner and longer-lasting food storage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor smarter everyday management, Mijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L supports remote control through Xiaomi Home app, allowing users to adjust temperature and modes from anywhere, alongside control via the exterior LED touch panel. It also supports Google Assistant and Amazon Alexa for hands-free voice commands.²⁹ Real-time notifications further help users stay informed, including alerts when the refrigerator door is left open to help reduce unnecessary energy loss and potential food waste.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/645_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/05/2026/4eada593f01407f8d069963735089580.jpg\" alt=\"In a modern kitchen, a silver double-door refrigerator stands against the wall, with a serene view of lakes and forests outside the window. The interior features wooden floors and minimalist furniture.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg: All-in-One Laundry Solution with Energy-Efficient Design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for efficient everyday laundry care, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg delivers 30% better energy efficiency than the EU Class A threshold.⁷ Equipped with a large 525mm drum and power wash technology,³⁰ it generates strong water flow for deeper and more effective cleaning. The dedicated hygiene mode combines high-temperature steam and hot water to eliminate 99.99% of bacteria, while the steam function can also be added to selected wash cycles for extra sanitization.⁸ Designed to adapt to different daily routines, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg offers over 30 wash programs,³¹ including a 15-minute quick wash³² for lightly soiled clothes and a one-tap wash-and-dry function for effortless everyday convenience. Powered by smart dry control, it uses 3D airflow and high-precision sensors to automatically stop drying once clothes reach the optimal condition, helping prevent overheating while keeping fabrics soft and ready to wear.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlending smart functionality with modern design, the washer-dryer features a clean white exterior paired with a colorful touch panel for a more intuitive user experience. Through the Xiaomi Home app, users can remotely control and monitor laundry cycles, customize settings with the My Time program, and save personalized preferences for one-tap access. For long-term use, over-the-air updates continuously add new features and refine wash programs, making everyday laundry smarter and more effortless.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/711_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/05/2026/35c5c1fbdd777baa88bc9d81cad58bca.jpg\" alt=\"A washing machine embedded in a wooden countertop, with open storage space beside it, and the background features curtains and plants, overall in a modern minimalist style.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro: Effortless Cleaning for Everyday Convenience\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEngineered for effortless everyday cleaning, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro combines edge-to-corner coverage, powerful suction, intelligent navigation, and a fully automated dock for a more complete hands-free cleaning experience. Dual robotic arms extend outward to reach edges and tight corners, reducing blind spots for more thorough coverage. Delivering 15,000Pa powerful suction,⁹ Xiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro efficiently handles dust, debris, and hair, while its dual anti-tangle system reduces hair wrap for more consistent performance.¹⁰ The intelligent obstacle avoidance system enables millimeter-level detection,³³ while advanced LDS laser navigation ensures precise movement around furniture, cables, and household objects.³⁴ When transitioning to carpets, it automatically lifts its mop pads and boosts suction for deeper cleaning performance.³⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe all-in-one auto base station integrates auto dust collection,³⁶ self-cleaning washboard, and hot-air drying into a single streamlined system for a truly hands-free experience. Xiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro also supports Xiaomi Home app control for remote scheduling and monitoring, as well as voice control via Google Assistant and Alexa,²⁹ enabling effortless everyday operation.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/432_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/05/2026/ac4990dd76523731a6c1ba59c1b5ce95.jpg\" alt=\"A white robotic vacuum cleaner is parked on the wooden floor, with light-colored walls in the background and a charging dock beside it.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMijia Air Conditioner Gentle Air, Mijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg, Xiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026, and Xiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro are now available on Xiaomi's official channels and authorized retailers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026 starting at \u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eEUR \u003c/span\u003e549\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMijia Air Conditioner GentleAir starting at \u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eEUR \u003c/span\u003e569\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L starting at \u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eEUR \u003c/span\u003e849\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg starting at \u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eEUR \u003c/span\u003e539\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro starting at \u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003eEUR \u003c/span\u003e499\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease visit \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003emi.com/global\u003c/a\u003e for more detailed information on these products and their features.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images are available here: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgC4GfQijTToQp4HRMWMWO2qAXZkiESrSoNzOyDAh5DbYic?e=lSvw0A\"\u003eXiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgB5LJPTgqluQ4IRDz46VYi1AWQufLohVaZZ8pUeEkaVFAo?e=dYYjvS\"\u003eMijia Air Conditioner GentleAir\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgAehjs2VBJrRJkNVNTyQ2R9AQxUDv9OAJNShSbfafS-7ls?e=G1G9WG\"\u003eMijia Refrigerator Side-by-Side 621L\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCyaUq328YuRoatsfw6wuEjAV2jLrFAG93bOjVnP9Pzf5w?e=Tska7Q\"\u003eMijia Front Load Washer Dryer 8kg\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgBgJKQJncO8SLzxx-a7b6PIAWNKwHGgD9xCcxmMVunL_Uk?e=hgnLZb\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum H50 Pro\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: black;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Data varies by sizes: 512 zones QD-Mini LED for 75'' version / 384 zones QD-Mini LED for 65'' version / 308 zones QD-Mini LED for 55'' version / 880 zones QD-Mini LED for 98'' version / 640 zones QD-Mini LED for 85'' version\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²120Hz refresh rate requires 120Hz Game Boost mode to be enabled in settings. Supports 120Hz HDMI input at 1920 × 1080 or 2560 × 1440 resolution.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ Dolby and the double-D symbol are trademarks of Dolby Laboratories Licensing Corporation. Requires video content that supports Dolby Audio™ and DTS:X decoding.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ For the 2.6 kW and 3.5 kW versions: According to Intertek's test reports, under specified initial conditions, the indoor unit outlet temperature decreased to below 22°C within 30 seconds in cooling mode (outdoor: 35°C DBT; indoor: 27°C DBT and 19°C WBT), and increased to above 36°C within 1 minute in heating mode (outdoor: 7°C DBT and 6°C WBT; indoor: 20°C DBT). Actual performance may vary depending on environmental conditions, installation quality, and user settings. For the 5.2 kW version: According to Intertek's test reports, under specified initial conditions, the indoor unit outlet temperature decreased to below 22°C within 30 seconds in cooling mode (outdoor: 35°C DBT; indoor: 27°C DBT and 19°C WBT), and increased to above 37°C within 1 minute in heating mode(outdoor: 7°C DBT and 6°C WBT; indoor: 20°C DBT). Actual performance may vary depending on environmental conditions, installation quality, and user settings. For the 7.0 kW version: According to Intertek's test reports, under specified initial conditions, the indoor unit outlet temperature decreased to below 23°C within 30 seconds in cooling mode (outdoor: 35°C DBT; indoor: 27°C DBT and 19°C WBT), and increased to above 39°C within 1 minute in heating mode(outdoor: 7°C DBT and 6°C WBT; indoor: 20°C DBT). Actual performance may vary depending on environmental conditions, installation quality, and user settings.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ According to Intertek's test reports, models ASH-12WO/R2C2-EU achieved 24.5% energy savings, with Mijia Al Energy Saving Mode on. Tested under the following temperature: indoor room 32°C, indoor wall 30°C, outdoor 35°C; duration: 3 hours. Actual performance may vary depending on room size, ambient temperature, installation, and user habits.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Ag⁺ Fresh is applied throughout the entire refrigerator, including both the fridge and freezer. Tested by Guangzhou Institute of Microbiology Group Co., Ltd. for the pollutants trimethylamine and methyl mercaptan, report No.: KJ2025003674E, and the microorganisms Staphylococcus aureus and Escherichia coli, report No.: WJ2025003283E(A).\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ The product is claimed to be 30% more energy-efficient in washing than the minimum threshold for Class A, as defined in EU Regulation 2019/2014. Testing was conducted by DEKRA Testing and Certification (Shanghai) Ltd., Hefei Branch, Report No.4705930.51. This information is provided for reference only and does not represent an official EU energy label or class.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Tested by TÜV SÜD Certification and Testing (China) Co., Ltd., Shanghai Branch in accordance with IEC/PAS 62958:2015, MOD. Under laboratory conditions, the Hygiene program achieved a\u0026gt;99.9999% reduction of Staphylococcus aureus and Escherichia coli. Actual results may vary depending on usage conditions. Steam is only available in certain programmes. Please refer to the actual product.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Tested with a vacuum gauge (range 0–35kPa, precision 0.01kPa) at the inlet of a fully charged robot vacuum, the maximum measured suction reached 15,000 Pa. Data comes from the manufacturer. Actual results may vary slightly depending on the testing environment.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Refers to the main unit's built-in \"Y\"-shaped comb teeth detangling technology and the anti-tangle side brush, which reduces hair wrapping around the main and side brushes during cleaning. Laboratory simulations mainly tested dry hair on the floor; cleaning performance for wet hair or fluff may vary depending on the home environment. Please refer to the actual usage experience.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ Compatible Google Assistant-enabled devices are required. Google Assistant is not available in certain languages and countries. Google, Google Home, and Google Nest Audio are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² Screen-to-body ratio data comes from Xiaomi TV Labs. The ratio is calculated as the display area divided by the total screen area. Minor variations may occur due to measurement differences.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ 1200nits peak brightness is a typical value measured with a 10%–50% HDR white window at 100% screen brightness. Actual results may vary depending on the testing software version, environment, and product model. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ Color gamut is a typical value based on data from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary due to differences in measurement methods. Please refer to the actual product.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵ 1.07 billion colors refers to each RGB subpixel of the LCD panel, achieving 10-bit color depth per primary color through software processing. The combination of RGB primary colors renders up to 2¹⁰ × 2¹⁰ × 2¹⁰ = 1.07 billion colors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶ Dolby, Dolby Atmos®, and Dolby Vision® and the double-D symbol are trademarks of Dolby Laboratories Licensing Corporation. Requires video content that supports Dolby Vision® and Dolby Atmos®.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁷ 120Hz refresh rate requires 120Hz Game Boost mode to be enabled in settings. Supports 120Hz HDMI input at 1920 × 1080 or 2560 × 1440 resolution.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁸ 144Hz refresh rate at 4K resolution is tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs under HDMI enhanced mode. Actual performance may vary depending on connected devices and usage conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁹ 288Hz refresh rate requires 288Hz Game Boost to be enabled in settings. Supports 288Hz HDMI input at 1920 × 1080 or 2560 × 1440 resolution.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁰ Dolby and the double-D symbol are trademarks of Dolby Laboratories Licensing Corporation. Requires video content that supports Dolby Audio™ and DTS:X decoding.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²¹ Dolby, Dolby Atmos®, and Dolby Vision® and the double-D symbol are trademarks of Dolby Laboratories Licensing Corporation. Requires video content that supports Dolby Vision® and Dolby Atmos®.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²² Google TV™ is the name of this device's software experience and a trademark of Google LLC. Requires Internet connection and a Google Account. Subscription, download, or purchase may be required for viewing. Some apps, content, and/or features may not be available in all countries. Subject to availability.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²³ Apple, AirPlay, iPad, iPhone are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries and regions. To use AirPlay with Xiaomi TV S Mini LED Series 2026, the latest version of iOS, iPadOS, or macOS is recommended.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁴ Google Assistant is not available in certain languages and countries. Please refer to the Google Assistant official website for more info. Requires Google Cast-enabled apps. Platforms and content may vary depending on your country or region. Please refer to the services available in your location for further details.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁵ Heating mode does not support gentle airflow.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁶ 4-way airflow is not supported in GentleAir mode.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁷ The feature automatically adjusts brightness to Off, Medium, or High based on needs.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁸ Data obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁹ Compatible Alexa and Google Assistant-enabled devices are required. Google Assistant is not available in certain languages and countries. Google, Google Home, and Google Nest Mini are trademarks of Google LLC. Alexa is not available in certain languages and countries, Amazon, Alexa, and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. Please refer to official websites for more information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁰ Power Wash function is only available in Smart Wash and Cold Wash modes.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³¹ 30+ programmes: 14 programmes on the control panel and 16 more to choose from in the Xiaomi Home app.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³² Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. For lightweight 1-2 kg loads, Quick Wash runs on a fixed 15-minute cycle without automatic time adjustment.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³³ Millimetre-level: The vacuum was tested in an automated sensor calibration rig. Four matte white panels were sequentially lowered at varying distances in front of the vacuum to measure the line-laser recognition accuracy. Results show millimetre-level precision, with a plane recognition error of ‡6mm. Detection of obstacles depends on environmental conditions and usage. Actual obstacle identification and avoidance may vary. Before the vacuum maps a new area, it is recommended to remove obstacles to ensure optimal performance. Obstacle avoidance effectiveness may vary depending on your home environment. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁴ LDS refers to Laser Distance Sensor.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁵ Mop pads automatically lift by 10mm. For carpets thicker than 8mm, long pile carpets, or carpets with fringes, we recommend selecting \"Avoid Carpet\" mode in the Xiaomi Home app. After completing the first cleaning, select the top-right corner of the map on the Xiaomi Home app homepage. Tap Map editing \u0026gt; Carpet editing \u0026gt; Add carpet area \u0026gt; Carpet preference, and enable \"Carpet Boost\".\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁶ As dust accumulation varies by household, the amount of dirt left on the mop pad after cleaning may differ. The base station's self-cleaning feature can help reduce dirt build-up and odours, but cannot eliminate them completely. Regular manual cleaning is recommended.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Embracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience, and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars.\u0026nbsp;The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 600,000 units by February 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better-connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index, and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"944","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1779973209"},"common":null}